### NOTE: Replace KEYCLOAK_TOKEN with actual JWT from Keycloak

### GET user via Gateway (requires Keycloak JWT token)
GET http://localhost:9090/api/users/70e91976-6a32-4393-b322-c2d720efd532
Authorization: Bearer KEYCLOAK_TOKEN

### Register a new user via Gateway
POST http://localhost:9090/api/users/register
Authorization: Bearer KEYCLOAK_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "keycloakId": "keycloak-user-id"
}

### Direct user-service endpoint (no auth required for testing)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/users/70e91976-6a32-4393-b322-c2d720efd532